      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRED'S FURY (2) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.29 beating Midnight Rebel. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. The hardest to beat again. MAC AND CHEESE (8) could manage only seventh at Healesville last time but caught the eye when clocking an outstanding 21.99 over 390m at Warrnambool the start prior. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. WIZZIN' BY (3) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (24.45) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Bendigo. Can do much better this time. ASTON CLEESE (1) is new to this circuit but warrants respect.",
